# Fiches projet : contexte de travail, pas du code.
.claude/projet/

# Session working notes: plans, reviews and handovers. They are written for
# whoever is holding the work today, not for a contributor, and they date fast.
# Keep them under .claude/projet/, which is already ignored above.
#
# The nine plans committed on 28/08 stay tracked for now: sessions are executing
# them, and pulling a plan out from under a running session is the collision this
# repository keeps paying for. They come out when the work they describe lands.
# This line stops the next one from arriving.
docs/plans/

# The log tooled sessions keep as they work: drafts, not code.
# Working notes of a tooled session: regenerable from git log.
.superpowers/
